  "name": "Operation Sleeping Leviathan VER2",
  "location": "African Coastline",
  "overview": "The walls of a massive fortress rise from a jagged ocean coast, its silhouette etched against the dying glow of the sun. Within its stone shell lies a dormant leviathan, a weapon once built to sweep entire fleets into silence beneath the waves. Once a symbol of unbreakable power, it now lingers as a whisper of possibility, entombed in stone and memory, waiting to be claimed once more.\n\nIntelligence reports enemy Mobile Suits advancing on the location of an abandoned coastal fortress, intent on breaching its walls and securing a powerful weapon within. Control of the weapon will give the enemy control of the surrounding ocean and tip the balance of power in their favor. All available forces are to advance on the fortress immediately to secure key strong points and prevent enemy incursion. We cannot allow the weapon to fall into enemy hands.",
  "objectives": "Secure key positions within and around the fortress to reinforce defenses. Each position controlled at the end of a Phase is worth victory points as outlined below.\n\n• Positions within the fortress in the center of the board are each worth 5 victory points.\n\n• Positions outside the fortress on the left and right sides of the board are each worth 8 victory points."
}
